- sqlite-vss: https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-vss
- nomic-embed: https://huggingface.co/nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5
- ONNX Runtime Node: https://onnxruntime.ai/docs/get-started/with-javascript.html

